      the same for the last mixture M^(n+1): max = 0.00000 at Q = ['x5']   (ratio to L/(n+1): 0.00)
    L = 8, n =  10: max over Q of Pr[round T meets Q, no earlier question in Q] = 0.58954 at Q = ['x1'];  L/n = 0.80000   (holds)
